      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "How do I know in session #1 that I \nneed to overwrite\n/contour/cached/session_1_DF\n?\n\nI don't. I just need to send signal to\nlinked sessions to rebuild\n\nOR\n\nIF file with session id == 1 exists\nthen overwrite cached with every \nother action \n\nOR\n\nHaving property linked_object = 2\n_ _ _\n\nOther sessions will check for hash \ndifference between previous and \ncurrent cached input file",
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "96RNGj-sYBbzzCwZiJekS",
      "originalText": "How do I know in session #1 that I need to overwrite\n/contour/cached/session_1_DF\n?\n\nI don't. I just need to send signal to \nlinked sessions to rebuild\n\nOR\n\nIF file with session id == 1 exists\nthen overwrite cached with every other action \n\nOR\n\nHaving property linked_object = 2\n_ _ _\n\nOther sessions will check for hash difference between previous and current cached input file",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 544
    },
